## Step 5: Run Finalization

### 5.1 Final Compact Progress Update

After the scheduling loop exits (`action == "budget_exhausted"`) and all still-running evotrias-task-executors have finished, emit one final compact progress line using the format below, taking `best_fitness` from the latest `check_convergence` diagnostics. Do not print a table or artifact paths.

### 5.2 Final Convergence Check & Finalize

```text
finalize_result = finalize_run(run_id)
```

### 5.3 Report

On normal stop, report only:

```text
Run finalized.
report_ref: <finalize_result.report_ref>
summary_ref: <finalize_result.summary_ref>
```

Do not write a long run summary yourself. The deterministic report is written by MCP to:

```text
runs/<run_id>/run_summary.md
runs/<run_id>/run_summary.json
```

